<title>INDIA: India Karur Vysa 96/97 net higher.</title>
<headline>India Karur Vysa 96/97 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		360.6     vs     322.4</p>
<p>    Interest earned     2,203.1     vs   1,734.9</p>
<p>    Other income	    329.6     vs     358.0</p>
